        "product_summary": "Synthetic leather upper: Layered panels are finished with a contrasting textured toe cap and curved forefoot seam.\nLace-up construction: Round eyelets and metal upper guides sit along a zigzag panel edge with visible stitching.\nTongue and heel loops: Webbing loops mark both the tongue and rear, alongside a low-cut mesh collar.\nTPR outsole design: Grey forefoot sections and black perimeter lugs form the actual contact pattern shown in the photos.\nTwo-colour wholesale assortment: Black and Brown are offered in EU 39–48 for colour-size order planning.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
